# .npmrc
# NOTE: Do NOT set node-options here — it applies to ALL node processes
# including npm install postinstall scripts (e.g. @swc/core), which run
# from a different CWD where ./_preload.cjs cannot be found, causing:
#   Error: Cannot find module './_preload.cjs'
# The preload hook is instead applied via build.js (see vercel.json buildCommand).
